*.uvoptx

# video build scratch
docs/guide/video/_narration.wav
docs/guide/video/_shot.png
docs/guide/video/_small.mp4

# build-all-hex generated projects and logs
firmware/keil/*_AT89S52_s.uvprojx
firmware/keil/*_AT89S52_x.uvprojx
firmware/keil/*_AT89S52_sx.uvprojx
firmware/keil/Logs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- HEX files
# Build output is ignored, because Objects/ is regenerated by every build.
# The 13 finished files in firmware/hex/ are the exception: they are the
# submission, they are small (about 4 KB each), and a reviewer may want the
# binaries without installing Keil. See firmware/hex/README.md.
*.hex
firmware/hex/*
!firmware/hex/README.md
!firmware/hex/*.hex
